\f0\b \cf0 The Problem We Solved:
\f1\b0  - System was classifying 84 sentences as \'e2\'80\'9cExpletive\'e2\'80\uc0\u157  when they should be \'e2\'80\'9cNo Expletive\'e2\'80\u157  - Only 11 sentences were missed as \'e2\'80\'9cExpletive\'e2\'80\u157  - This 84:11 imbalance showed the system was too generous with expletive predictions\
